flf2a$ 7 7 10 -1 6 0 0 0
NibbleBits -- custom 0/1 FIGfont, version 1.0 (2026).
Originally the Cosmeron Binary Orbit font; kept as NibbleBits.
Sharp geometric letterforms composed solely of 0 and 1.
7-row display, full width (no kerning or smushing).
All 95 printable ASCII glyphs plus FIGlet's seven extended slots.
License: EUPL-1.2-or-later (aligned with the Cosmeron project).
